{"reviewId": "14755045_86xHFGfsa", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "​​经验意义与投资启示​​\n• 上述规律为判断所处的康波阶段提供了价格信号：若通胀持续低迷且波动加大，可能已进入衰退或萧条。\n• 在繁荣、回升期应侧重进攻型资产（股票、成长型债券等）；衰退、萧条期则需降低杠杆、配置防御或避险资产（黄金、高评级债券）。\n• 由于价格在衰退、萧条期的剧烈变化往往领先于宏观数据，投资者应关注高频价格指标，以便提前调整组合。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "(1)康波的繁荣期百分之百价格平稳；(2)康波的回升期三次中有两次价格平稳；(3)康波的衰退期价格百分之百剧烈波动；(4)康波的萧条期百分之百冲高回落", "range": "12271-12346", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "14755045_86xHFGfsa", "userVid": 14755045, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769764950, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 14755045, "name": "宣竞", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eribDf5WbXhckyg2M2mb40M8BxVy6hmycicsKI8utaeYLiaNlHia20fGHzF0Pw2hsibrvZQ0k3rzHMaKjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "仁者如射，射者正己而后发；发而不中，不怨胜己者，反求诸己而已", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 12995231, "name": "📿仲玥侨RICO", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/H3QexAdH2dzphIeU149agV9WibQpXENBV1gLQs4ZRRvicvCgF2lCyCyzFKXvKuolzQZ3xl5IW9ClY/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "我们现在是属于萧条期吗？那会持续几年呢", "reviewId": "14755045_86xHFGfsa", "commentId": "14755045_86xHFGfsa_c244